54
00:01:48.076 --> 00:01:48.737
installation.

55
00:01:49.237 --> 00:01:51.620
For macOS, the installer usually works

56
00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.282
without extra steps.

57
00:01:53.282 --> 00:01:55.888
Now, if you're using Linux, Python might

58
00:01:55.928 --> 00:01:58.373
already be installed, but this can vary by

59
00:01:58.453 --> 00:01:59.095
distribution.

60
