85
00:02:48.729 --> 00:02:49.289
For instance:

86
00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:53.053
print(42) This will display: 42 Now, you

87
00:02:53.093 --> 00:02:54.474
can also do calculations.

88
00:02:55.075 --> 00:02:57.417
For example, if you write: print(7 * 6)

89
00:02:57.898 --> 00:03:00.140
This will give you: 42 And if you

90
00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:00.460
add:

91
