95
00:03:10.074 --> 00:03:11.996
A program is just a series of lines

96
00:03:12.036 --> 00:03:13.977
that run one after another, from top to

97
00:03:14.037 --> 00:03:14.358
bottom.

98
00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:17.741
For example, if we write: name = "Ada"

99
00:03:17.801 --> 00:03:18.061
print("Hello,",

100
00:03:19.022 --> 00:03:21.764
name) print("Welcome to Python!") When you

101
